1. Entry letter "B" in Box 8, for products which meet the origin criteria according to paragraph 3. "Entry of letter would be
followed by the sum of the value of materials, parts or produce originating from non-Contracting States, or undetermined
origin used, expressed as a percentage of the f.o.b. value of the products; (example "E" 50 per cent);

2. Enter letter "C" in Box 8 for products which meet the origin criteria according to paragraph 4. Entry of letter "C" would
be followed by the sum of the aggregate content originating in the territory of the exporting Contracting State expressed
as a percentage of the f.o.b. value of the exported product; (example "C" 60 percent);
